            "value" : "Molo, bendisebenzisa i-Session ukuncokola ngokupheleleyo ngokukhuselekileyo. Yiza ujoyine nam! ID yami yeAkhawunti ngu<br/><br/>{account_id}<br/><br/>Khuphela kwi https://getsession.org/download"
